WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:08.190
这是代码画布的网页版。打开设计实验室，
就能看到三个关于光线、色彩和空间的习作。
This is Code Canvas for the web. The Design Lab opens with three studies in light, color, and space.

2
00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:18.190
打开珊瑚习作，放大看曲线的细节，再打开对齐网格。点百分比，就能回到全图。
Open Coral study and zoom in on the ribbon. Turn on the alignment grid. Tap the percentage to fit the
artwork again.

3
00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:25.690
返回作品库，也可以导入自己的文件。这里打开的是一幅矢量图。
Back in the library, you can import your own file. Here I'm opening a standalone SVG illustration.

4
00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:35.690
点右上角的菜单，选择源码。改一下图上的标题，再点应用并预览。
Open the top-right menu and choose Source. Edit the title, then choose Apply and Preview to see the result.

5
00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:44.190
手机上也是同样的作品库和画布。无需登录，导入的文件保存在当前浏览器里。
The same library and canvas work on a phone. No sign-in is needed. Imports stay in this browser.

6
00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:54.190
最后，从作品菜单导出源文件，留一份备份。
网页版和安卓版的功能不同，项目主页有各自的入口。
Finally, export the source from the artwork menu to keep a backup. The web and Android apps have separate
links on the project page.
